@page "/"

<PageTitle>Index</PageTitle>

<h1>Hello, world!</h1>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
    
        <div class="card shadow p-3 mb-5  rounded">
            <div class="card-header fw-bold text-uppercase">
                Purpose
            </div>
            <div class="card-body fst-italic text-">
                <p>
                    This application provides a sample base for testing the SnowStorm components and provide a sample of how an application could hang together.
                    This application is scalable and can be used as small web app or a full enterprise level application.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card shadow p-3 mb-5 rounded">
            <div class="card-header fw-bold text-uppercase">
                Technical Overview
            </div>
            <div class="card-body fst-italic">
                <p>
                    This application consists of a Blazor Web Assembly application using a ASP.NET Core REST API application to provide back-end
                    services like data access and CRUD operations.
                </p>
                <p>
                    It uses a  DbUp project to keep the database schema up to date and is used in the code testing of the application.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer">
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
        <div class="card shadow p-3 mb-5 rounded">
            <div class="card-header fw-bold text-uppercase">
                Functional
            </div>
            <div class="card-body fst-italic">
                <p>
                    Overview of the features of the application.  The business problem being solved.
                </p>
                <p><b>Creating and storing weather forecast data for a region per day.</b></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Regions
                        <ul>
                            <li>View Regions</li>
                            <li>Create Region</li>
                            <li>Update Region</li>
                            <li>Delete Region</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Weather Forecasts
                        <ul>
                            <li>View weather forecast for today for all regions.</li>
                            <li>View weather forecast for selected date and selected region.</li>
                            <li>
                                Generate new forecast for selected day and specified region.
                                <ul>
                                    <li>If forecast exists, then update the existing records.</li>
                                </ul>
                            </li>
                            <li>Delete existing forecast for selected day and specified region.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer small fw-bold">
                Snow storms are a specific weather phenomena...
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
        <div class="card shadow p-3 mb-5 rounded">
            <div class="card-header  fw-bold text-uppercase">
                Testing
            </div>
            <div class="card-body fst-italic">
                <p>
                    This application uses <b>Functional End to End testing</b> instead of normal unit testing.  This means that nothing that is accessible in the solution is mocked.
                    All internal components are tested together as a unit.  This ensures that you code will deploy and run where as mocked unit tests gives you zero gaurentee that your
                    code will run once deployed.
                </p>
                <p>
                    The testing project in this solution provides several examples of how this functional end to end testing could be done.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

   
</div>